   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FGU301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>Unity Official Document</strong>; <strong>Microsoft Learn: C#</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13152 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FGU301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Unity Official Document</strong>; <strong>Microsoft Learn: C#</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13152 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Unity Official Document</strong></td><td>Unity Technologies</td><td>Unity Technologies</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/index.html</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Microsoft Learn: C#</strong></td><td>Microsoft</td><td>Microsoft</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/tour-of-csharp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/tour-of-csharp/</a><br>overview</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>C# Programming for Unity Game Development Specialization</strong></td><td>University of Colorado System</td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/programming-unity-game-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/programming-unity-game-development</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Unity Learn Platform</strong></td><td>Unity Technologies</td><td>Unity Technologies</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learn.unity.com</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Unity Official Channel</strong></td><td>Unity Technologies</td><td>Youtube</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@unity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/@unity</a></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Internet<br><br>- Visual Studio 2019 or later (C# programming language)<br><br>- Unity Hub and Unity 5 (version 2021.3 LTS or later)<br><br>- Minimum hardware requirement: Windows 10, 64-bit versions, CPU: X64, RAM: 8GB<br><br>- Students use Unity with their personal email for educational purposes only</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Internet<br><br>- Visual Studio 2019 or later (C# programming language)<br><br>- Unity Hub and Unity 5 (version 2021.3 LTS or later)<br><br>- Minimum hardware requirement: Windows 10, 64-bit versions, CPU: X64, RAM: 8GB<br><br>- Students use Unity with their personal email for educational purposes only</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13152</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13152</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
